                "entry_id": "9c8a1883-03d0-3bd9-90ab-ff2063a9837d",
                "word": "épouvantablement",
                "pos": "adv",
                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "a4754617-51df-38ac-9961-5ed931052b84",
                        "entry_id": "9c8a1883-03d0-3bd9-90ab-ff2063a9837d",
                        "glosses": [
                            "D'une manière épouvantable, excessive."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "8c7a364f-2aed-4129-b022-cbbbe138c237",
                                "sense_id": "a4754617-51df-38ac-9961-5ed931052b84",
                                "text": "Cet homme est épouvantablement laid."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "e551bd56-b76e-4818-a731-f22dd268cd56",
                                "sense_id": "a4754617-51df-38ac-9961-5ed931052b84",
                                "text": "Cet homme-là vous aime épouvantablement. — (Jean-François Regnard, le Joueur. II, 5.)"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "51ffd671-0c66-4a45-9aa3-389e145c5d86",
                                "sense_id": "a4754617-51df-38ac-9961-5ed931052b84",
                                "text": "Entraîneur du club anglais, le Français Claude Puel n’était pas à bord de l’appareil. Joint dimanche par Franceinfo, le technicien a confirmé aller bien, et déploré « une tragédie pour le club ». « Je pense très fort aux victimes et à leurs familles et je voulais rassurer tous les gens qui s’inquiètent me concernant. Je suis épouvantablement triste mais je vais bien », a-t-il témoigné."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "b70dcc85-8bcd-442b-84f1-9a659cc03d2e",
                        "source_entry_id": "9c8a1883-03d0-3bd9-90ab-ff2063a9837d",
                        "source_sense_id": "a4754617-51df-38ac-9961-5ed931052b84",
                        "target_lang_word": "appallingly",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "appallingly",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d135e0b8-e67e-3aa9-8426-04b329633eb6",
                                        "entry_id": "b6881c60-0bcc-3a01-a43a-e9d97a57ca48",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "In an appalling manner."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9d91a009-9a16-4c43-850c-b84e20a71e4d",
                                                "sense_id": "d135e0b8-e67e-3aa9-8426-04b329633eb6",
                                                "text": "She performed appallingly on standard neurological tests, which are, as Sacks perceptively notes, specifically designed to deconstruct the whole person into a stack of 'abilities'."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "853fc850-639f-4e85-82c6-f2e181f66754",
                        "source_entry_id": "9c8a1883-03d0-3bd9-90ab-ff2063a9837d",
                        "source_sense_id": "a4754617-51df-38ac-9961-5ed931052b84",
                        "target_lang_word": "dreadfully",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "dreadfully",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "94c395d4-d4c6-3f08-be36-32cc3b26b906",
                                        "entry_id": "32bc75ea-7e5c-33b1-858c-d086d185c20f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "In a dreadful manner; terribly."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "599e71ce-9c61-4317-9274-e7f60bad3536",
                                                "sense_id": "94c395d4-d4c6-3f08-be36-32cc3b26b906",
                                                "text": "You behaved dreadfully yesterday night"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5018de07-1c29-47a5-bf53-d8fd4acc26bd",
                                                "sense_id": "94c395d4-d4c6-3f08-be36-32cc3b26b906",
                                                "text": "The smellful old heathen was snoring dreadfully."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "620d5562-5732-39f9-9326-ec1bdcfb3569",
                                        "entry_id": "32bc75ea-7e5c-33b1-858c-d086d185c20f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Exceptionally, eminently, very much."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "dated"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bc17c583-6508-4475-bd7c-5edbc5ecfe97",
                                                "sense_id": "620d5562-5732-39f9-9326-ec1bdcfb3569",
                                                "text": "That restaurant seems dreadfully expensive."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "decabd5a-c069-4871-9803-4f4bd460a01f",
                                                "sense_id": "620d5562-5732-39f9-9326-ec1bdcfb3569",
                                                "text": "At that moment a curious crack sounded inside the statue, as if something had broken. The fact is that the leaden heart had snapped right in two. It certainly was a dreadfully hard frost."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1d5283ef-8d94-49c7-9d46-05132f5adfe5",
                                                "sense_id": "620d5562-5732-39f9-9326-ec1bdcfb3569",
                                                "text": "“Here it is,” said Eddie. “‘Why Must it Always be Tomato Soup?’ It's so deeply true, don't you feel? Tomato soup is so dreadfully eternal.”"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "f785c925-9ca8-437b-903a-7418e55cc970",
                        "source_entry_id": "9c8a1883-03d0-3bd9-90ab-ff2063a9837d",
                        "source_sense_id": "a4754617-51df-38ac-9961-5ed931052b84",
                        "target_lang_word": "terribly",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "terribly",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "cd19504b-5b12-315d-b300-ddc21f3a1b69",
                                        "entry_id": "d156e205-deb9-3e55-a092-7ab8202dfb94",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "So as to cause terror or awe."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "dated",
                                            "literary"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f9d1ba60-1fa5-43b4-8a9d-9e77b73529db",
                                                "sense_id": "cd19504b-5b12-315d-b300-ddc21f3a1b69",
                                                "text": "The lion roared terribly."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9ed5cc78-a990-4ec5-9c52-7594ff64788f",
                                                "sense_id": "cd19504b-5b12-315d-b300-ddc21f3a1b69",
                                                "text": "The mere sensuous impact of trumpet or saxophone, whatever it happened to be playing, was an echo, even though a faint echo, of that excitement and abandon. He wanted to taste, smell, hear: his senses were terribly alive."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e02018c0-36cc-34bd-9ebb-c9412e89c01f",
                                        "entry_id": "d156e205-deb9-3e55-a092-7ab8202dfb94",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Very; extremely."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "56de0aca-3a08-4e3d-9e3a-b6853a38c093",
                                                "sense_id": "e02018c0-36cc-34bd-9ebb-c9412e89c01f",
                                                "text": "He's terribly busy and you really shouldn't bother him."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b5ff6d43-98c3-4b61-a2f1-a39ccfbec0dc",
                                                "sense_id": "e02018c0-36cc-34bd-9ebb-c9412e89c01f",
                                                "text": "The parsnip, stilton and chestnut combination may taste good, but it's not terribly decorative. In fact, dull's the word, a lingering adjectival ghost of nut roasts past that I'm keen to banish from the table."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d1e30b7e-62a6-3d0a-99ca-bcb37abadf3c",
                                        "entry_id": "d156e205-deb9-3e55-a092-7ab8202dfb94",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Very badly."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e690d9bc-08b6-4242-9f3b-a669ea84a063",
                                                "sense_id": "d1e30b7e-62a6-3d0a-99ca-bcb37abadf3c",
                                                "text": "She took part in the karaoke, but sang terribly."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
